.TH LIRIA 1 "October 2026" "SDE" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
liria \- Liria file manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B liria
[OPTIONS] FILES...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Browse files with the native Liria file manager. Desktop ownership is disabled by default so SDE keeps its wallpaper and icons.
.PP
This is an independent native executable built from the SDE fork sources
and included in the sde package.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --help
Display the native application options.
.SH COPYRIGHT
Original upstream copyrights and licenses are preserved. Settings at the SDE
Suite page provides the source link and full installed notice.
.SH SEE ALSO
